Z||000006||StuGood||12-13-2000||10:49 PM||||That's a pretty cool riddle, Phil  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  It made me think about things.  Now I feel kind of like a jerk, for figuring it out and giving it away  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>I was stumped until I broke it down into parts.  I read the first line all by itself, "What is greater than God -?" And said to myself, "Well, nothing!"  After that, I tried it on the other lines, and saw that it all fit.<P>I still think it's cool.  Thanks, Phil  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  ||||reg||6
